Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.94,0:00:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,How many times have I told you, Paddi?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.62,0:00:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t eat while driving.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.30,0:00:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to focus on the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.78,0:00:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ve still got a stash.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.66,0:00:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.70,0:00:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If you ever eat and drive again, I’ll throw it all out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.50,0:00:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.06,0:01:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s a sweet-tooth aphid!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.98,0:01:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you can’t have this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.02,0:01:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t eat my candy!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.90,0:01:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.10,0:01:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m coming down to get you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.66,0:01:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi there, little goats.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.70,0:01:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.06,0:01:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The Energy Seed is mine at last.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.62,0:01:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolnie and I can stay young forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.94,0:02:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.66,0:02:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m definitely not telling you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.94,0:02:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,that Weslie fell out of the train and got dragged away by an aphid.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.66,0:02:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Please stop talking, Paddi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.22,0:02:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see! I’ll go find him right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.62,0:02:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Good thing I didn’t tell him
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.94,0:02:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,that the safe box’s locks are time-sensitive.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.22,0:02:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,If the prints turn dark,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.30,0:02:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,that means it needs the handprints again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.66,0:02:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.78,0:02:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I’ll take the Energy Seed with me,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.22,0:02:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,and I’ll make Weslie open the lock as soon as I find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.54,0:02:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Justice Spider, take the goats back to Sirius
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.02,0:02:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,and keep an eye on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.98,0:02:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.14,0:02:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Give back my lollipop!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.58,0:03:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,There you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.50,0:03:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.30,0:03:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The Energy Seed? Where did you get that from?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.46,0:03:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm-hm. Your handprint is all that’s left.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.10,0:03:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me your hand right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.98,0:03:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Here comes a honey fruit!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.50,0:03:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Here comes another one!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.74,0:04:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Open the Energy Seed box.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.38,0:04:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.50,0:04:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.86,0:04:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.50,0:04:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,While he’s asleep, I’ll count down from three,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.26,0:04:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,and we’ll run in five separate directions
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.18,0:05:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,so he won’t be able to catch us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.90,0:05:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.10,0:05:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Three, two, one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.26,0:05:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Trying to run?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.26,0:05:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Not happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.94,0:05:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what? Untie me, and let’s duel, if you dare.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.74,0:05:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure. I’m not scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.82,0:05:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re not going to win just because you’re taller!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.26,0:05:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Although I’m short—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.10,0:05:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Although… Although I’m short…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.18,0:05:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think I want to be so short?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.70,0:05:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you like to grow taller?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.86,0:05:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes! I would.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.38,0:05:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a quick fix.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.14,0:06:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Why isn’t it working?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.18,0:06:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s the wrong hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.78,0:06:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.02,0:06:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie’s hand is mine! Don’t touch it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.94,0:06:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I shower daily! Don’t be so dramatic!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.14,0:06:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.10,0:06:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,One thousand one hundred and eleven,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.38,0:06:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,one thousand one hundred and twelve,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.82,0:07:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,one thousand one hundred and thirteen!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.34,0:07:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re on your way to growing!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.98,0:07:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.82,0:07:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m too tired. I can’t jump anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.26,0:07:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,This is what a taller you will look like.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.66,0:07:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,How handsome!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.18,0:07:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Persistence is key.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.18,0:07:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,This will be you very soon
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.94,0:07:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,as long as you keep jumping rope.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.42,0:07:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, can you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.90,0:07:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.98,0:07:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What’s that? I can’t hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.02,0:07:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I can!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.30,0:07:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.30,0:07:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We’ll head outside and not bother your training.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.98,0:07:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep it up, Justice Spider!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.18,0:07:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.54,0:07:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t slow down!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.82,0:07:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.50,0:07:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep it up! Don’t stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.22,0:07:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.58,0:07:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring it on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.15,0:08:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess it didn’t work.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.90,0:08:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Can we try something else?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.30,0:08:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Look over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.38,0:08:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, can we try?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.15,0:08:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.38,0:08:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,This is some really sticky fruit sap, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.50,0:08:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It’ll soften up with a bit more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.32,0:08:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Can we try something else?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.54,0:08:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.50,0:08:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.98,0:09:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yay, my hand is out!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.94,0:09:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Your hand might be free, but the honey is still on my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.62,0:09:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.82,0:09:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,let’s get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.70,0:09:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,My leg is stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.10,0:09:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there, Wolffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.74,0:09:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m getting you out!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.38,0:10:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! The aphid is gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.98,0:10:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for rescuing me, Weslie.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.62,0:10:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.98,0:10:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for helping me open the box, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.66,0:10:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The Energy Seed is mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.58,0:10:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.74,0:10:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The other goats’ handprints have expired.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.78,0:10:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.82,0:10:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Justice Spider?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.18,0:10:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m… over… here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.10,0:10:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Two thousand and fifteen,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.06,0:10:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,two thousand and sixteen,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.10,0:10:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,two thousand and seventeen,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.98,0:10:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,two thousand and eighteen,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.02,0:10:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,two thousand and nineteen…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.62,0:10:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are the goats?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.34,0:10:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Two thousand—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.42,0:10:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,How… How would I know?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.34,0:10:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m busy jumping rope to get taller.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.14,0:10:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Two thousand and—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.10,0:10:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Darn it, I forgot how many times I’ve jumped.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.70,0:10:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t… disturb… me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.42,0:10:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s no use, Wolffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.10,0:11:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, if I have the Energy Seed, I’ll just capture you guys again, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.82,0:11:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Come get us, Wolffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.26,0:11:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.50,0:11:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Sirius!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.98,0:11:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,This is our little “present” for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.86,0:11:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you like it, Wolffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.30,0:11:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You can run for all I care.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.74,0:11:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The Energy Seed is still in my hands, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.26,0:11:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what’s this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.98,0:11:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,When you were carrying me just now,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.78,0:11:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I stole it back from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.14,0:11:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.46,0:11:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re not going anywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.62,0:11:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, by the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.02,0:11:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,we turned your missiles into boomerangs.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.58,0:12:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Where’s Wolffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.39,0:12:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,A stupid missile is no match for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.86,0:12:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m taller! I really am!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.50,0:12:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy, Justice Spider, goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.74,0:12:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye! Thank you for your height fix!
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
